      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A customizer that can be implemented by beans wishing to customize the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/client/RestTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.client\"><code>RestTestClient.Builder</code></a> to fine-tune its auto-configuration before a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/client/RestTestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.client\"><code>RestTestClient</code></a> is created.",
