      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotation that can be applied to a test class to enable a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/client/RestTestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.client\"><code>RestTestClient</code></a>.",
